      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Senator, Section 4b is a targeted jolt that secures domestic lead positions and floods the market with capital, guaranteeing robust, stable growth for our local industry. By channeling every credit directly into high-volume manufacturing, we are building an unshakeable foundation that future-proofs American jobs while attracting the very investment needed for expansion. This is not just a subsidy; it is a strategic engine designed to deliver immediate momentum and sustained leadership within our solar sector.",
      "source": "target",
